      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{5a1d6af6b925f61c783fb042|full_name}: Yeah. The box perfectly matched my model's height (from head to bottom of the feet) in the video. To fix the issue, I ended up extending it vertically.\n\nIt seems like a VRChat issue, though, since the problem couldn't even be replicated in the Unity editor, so I haven't deleted this post yet. Plus, having to extend the box is a bit awkward, especially since the bounding box matched the one on the example avatar (his was from head to bottom of the feet, too)...",
