  "details": "Example 1 (the bug happening to me): https://transfer.sh/Ys4gj/1515057015-a01df70b-835b-4e99-a7a4-554c5f450c60.mp4\n\nExample 2 (from poke's stream on January 6th): https://www.twitch.tv/videos/215889171?t=01h54m10s\n\nIt's not the cubed shader in this instance. The person recording me in the first example has an nvidia card and we've tried with the standard shader.\n\nTo get rid of this bug, I have matched everything with the example avatar that comes to the SDK, but nothing has fixed it.\n\nadditional details: Can't be replicated in unity engine with SDK or blender. It specifically only happens in the VRChat Client.",
